' ===========================================================================
' ADMIN DASHBOARD (backend/planning/1)
'
' The seven routers the admin dashboard adds, with their services and adapters.
' Same three-layer shape as the auth/onboarding half above: a router does HTTP
' and authorization, a service holds the rule, a repository is the only thing
' that speaks to Postgres.
'
' Every write in this half goes through a SECURITY DEFINER RPC rather than a
' PostgREST insert, because each one touches more than one table and PostgREST
' has no client-side transaction. Reads go through security_invoker views, so
' RLS still decides what the caller sees.
' ===========================================================================
