legend left
  <b>Legend</b>
  solid arrow: state/result flow   dashed arrow: dependency
  «router»: FastAPI HTTP boundary  «service»: application rule
  «repository»: Supabase/PostgREST adapter
  «Zustand render cache»: never persists tenant data
  Browser authorization is never inferred from JWT roles; an active
  community_memberships record supplies tenant scope and role.
